<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Precision 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Precision 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			    873   vs     1,009</p>
<p>    Net				  20.14   vs     23.27</p>
<p>    Turnover			2,450.65   vs  1,985.92</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, in stock)</p>
<p>				 common     11   vs	  10</p>
<p>				 preferred  12   vs	  11</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyundai Precision &amp; Industry Co Ltd, a unit of the Hyundai Group, will hold its shareholders' meeting on February 28.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
